  Description: 'Regatta course-pool entry 3, shuffle course Ref4 (Wild3)
    (CellTypeChoiceOptions.CourseVariantWise, list order = Regatta Course Pool order - the
    host deals one enabled entry per match). A searched course: its rails prefab carries the
    whole RegattaCourseGenome (circuit, braid, features, placements), the one the real-game
    judge raced. Wide search shard_cloud3-0089: Corona world, super-shielded 9%, no rails,
    nucleus, lifeforms Orrery Cell/Orrery Cell Config, lap 4948 u. Field spread {''card'':
    2.094, ''L5'': 2.972} (3 seeds, real-game judge). 4061 prisms measured; PhaseThresholds
    ride that count at the rail prism''s nominal volume plus a trail band. Flora and fauna:
    Orrery Cell/Orrery Cell Config''s spawn profile. Regenerate with
    Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json, never
    by hand.'
